title: Password-protected archive with the password on the page
severity: high
score: 50
tags: malware-download, defense-evasion
attack: T1027.013, T1204.002
description: A downloaded archive is encrypted and the page prints the password. This
  pattern stops SEGs and browsers from scanning the contents.
---
// A password-protected archive was downloaded ...
encrypted_archive_entries
// ... and a page prints its password (string downloads.archive_password_on_page).
| where page_text() matches list("downloads.archive_password_on_page")
| project archive, name
